cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Articulatio-DE: German LoRA training recipe for Breeze TTS 2"
abstract: >-
  Training and evaluation pipeline for a German (plus English) LoRA adapter on
  top of Breeze TTS 2, a codec language model for text-to-speech, with
  rare-word coverage, Common Voice selection, sampler re-weighting and
  noise-augmented reference prompts.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Christoph"
    family-names: "Lindl-Guk"
    alias: "eigenhand"
repository-code: "https://github.com/eigenhand/articulatio-training"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - text-to-speech
  - LoRA
  - PEFT
  - German
  - codec language model
